# A list mapped element by element into a target list that list.UniqueItems constrains: the checker reads only length validators on a mapped list (#163).
-- source.cue --
items: [...int]
-- target.cue --
import "list"
items: [...int] & list.UniqueItems()
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {items: [for x in v0_0.items {x}]}
-- out --
unknown
v1_0.items has one element per element of v0_0.items, and the target list must satisfy list.UniqueItems, which constrains the list beyond its length; the checker reads list.MinItems and list.MaxItems on a mapped list, and nothing else (rule unknown-target-constraint) @ lens.cue:2:8
